      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-setup",
      "narration": "Your agent does the rest. It sets up read-only access to your Drive, and two Requests that can change sharing, which your prompt already allowed. Then it publishes the app, and gives you its link.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "image": "030--setup.png",
          "focus": [
            0,
            0,
            1280,
            720
          ],
          "frame": [
            96,
            110,
            1088,
            500
          ],
          "zoom": 1.12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-scan",
      "narration": "Open the app, and click Scan Drive. It lists each person who can open your files, and the files they can open, with their access level. Files in shared drives are read one at a time, so a big drive takes a little longer.",
